    "Html": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When I dove into the scientific research for my book </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/book/how-not-to-age/\"><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">How Not to Age</span></i></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, I uncovered the best ways we can care for our skin as we mature. What are the most important lifestyle factors? The best topical creams? Are there any beneficial procedures? This infographic summarizes the main takeaways.</span></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-113218\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-1.jpg\" alt=\"skincare infographic 1\" width=\"770\" height=\"996\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-1.jpg 770w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-1-768x993.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-1-720x931.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-1-540x698.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\"/></p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-113220\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-2.jpg\" alt=\"skincare infographic 2\" width=\"770\" height=\"996\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-2.jpg 770w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-2-768x993.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-2-720x931.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-2-540x698.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-113222\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-3.jpg\" alt=\"skincare infographic 3\" width=\"770\" height=\"996\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-3.jpg 770w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-3-768x993.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-3-720x931.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-3-540x698.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\"/></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-113224\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-4.jpg\" alt=\"skincare infographic 4\" width=\"770\" height=\"885\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-4.jpg 770w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-4-768x883.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-4-720x828.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2025/03/care-for-your-skin-as-you-age-4-540x621.jpg 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\"/></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Get this infographic as a downloadable PDF with citations </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.box.com/s/cccze5zt5noq82iohfncm8jcuem9zhcn\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">here</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For more details about the studies referenced in this infographic, watch the related videos for free on NutritionFacts.org’s </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL5TLzNi5fYd-faHnAnqFHgciU2PEWjLuw\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">YouTube channel</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or on our website’s </span><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/anti-aging/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Anti-aging topic page</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span></p>"
